	(text "MON_FAULT (diode-OR, 13 V = fault) clamps every channel (sheet 03). BIAS_OK_PRE = no fault, pulled up from +15 V (22k / 10k: 4.5-4.9 V; +15 V missing = not OK) -> Schmitt buffer (sheet 04) -> BIAS_OK_A. Independent of BIAS_EN (interfaces.md 6.3, 8)."
