	(text "Watchdog: only a toggling BIAS_EN (5-15 kHz, 5 V) charges WST and turns Q203 on, releasing the clamps (CLAMP_WD low). Stopped high or low, card missing: cold in 76-131 ms. R229 1k limits the card's 74AHCT to 3.8 mA peak (control board request >= 470 ohm); R230 56k (was 100k) for the 5 V drive."
